%% MDM enrollment as built at 5d400cf75. Source of truth for enrollment-flow.svg;
%% re-render after editing: mmdc -i enrollment-flow.mmd -o enrollment-flow.svg
sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator (darkbloom enroll)
    participant K as Coordinator
    participant M as MicroMDM
    participant D as Device (mdmclient)

    O->>K: GET /v1/enroll (no auth)
    K->>M: fetch SCEP CA + MDM enrollment settings
    K-->>O: application/x-apple-aspen-config<br/>SCEP payload + MDM payload<br/>PayloadIdentifier io.darkbloom.enroll<br/>CMS-signed when PROFILE_SIGNING_P12_* is set
    O->>D: open profile, operator approves in System Settings
    D->>M: SCEP: device key + certificate request
    M-->>D: device certificate
    D->>M: MDM check-in (Authenticate, TokenUpdate)
    Note over D,M: device now reachable via APNs (MDM topic)

    Note over K,M: later, on each provider WebSocket connection
    K->>M: SecurityInfo (and DevicePropertiesAttestation) commands by UDID
    M->>D: APNs wake
    D->>M: command results
    M->>K: POST /v1/mdm/webhook<br/>X-Webhook-Token = EIGENINFERENCE_MDM_WEBHOOK_SECRET<br/>body ≤ 1 MiB
    K-->>K: match CommandUUID → hardware grant / MDA flag
